<title>SRI LANKA: Sri Lanka Q1 '97 coconut crop at 614.1 mln nuts.</title>
<headline>Sri Lanka Q1 '97 coconut crop at 614.1 mln nuts.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1997-05-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sri Lanka's coconut crop in the first three months of this year fell two percent to 614.1 million nuts from 626.5 million nuts in the same period in 1996, the Central Bank said on Monday.</p>
</text>
